{"name": "Inversion Day", "description": "<div class=\"game_area_description\" id=\"game_area_description\">\n<h2>About This Game</h2>\n<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">When mysterious alien forces abduct humanity, one boy and his dog awaken aboard a colossal  spaceship drifting through  space. Armed with powerful artifacts capable of inverting the world around them, they must escape impossible environments, uncover hidden truths, and discover what lies deeper within the ship.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"360\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4436240/extras/7b260a902bb3d9e19be630e296b910d5.poster.avif?t=1789286668\" width=\"640\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4436240/extras/7b260a902bb3d9e19be630e296b910d5.webm?t=1789286668\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4436240/extras/7b260a902bb3d9e19be630e296b910d5.mp4?t=1789286668\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Invert Reality</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Use mysterious alien artifacts to manipulate and invert the space around you</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Traverse impossible architecture and solve puzzles built around shifting perspectives</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Each new mechanic expands the way you interact with the world</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"360\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4436240/extras/cb0ff5685ab7c638346eadb2cabc2798.poster.avif?t=1789286668\" width=\"640\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4436240/extras/cb0ff5685ab7c638346eadb2cabc2798.webm?t=1789286668\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4436240/extras/cb0ff5685ab7c638346eadb2cabc2798.mp4?t=1789286668\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">A Handcrafted Puzzle Journey</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Over 100 handcrafted puzzles ranging from accessible challenges to brutally difficult endgame mysteries</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Explore interconnected areas filled with hidden paths, secrets, and optional discoveries</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Detailed pixel art enhanced with cinematic lighting in a haunting neon environment</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"360\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4436240/extras/ce90e3d355c6a3adc8804e3335b4db3a.poster.avif?t=1789286668\" width=\"640\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4436240/extras/ce90e3d355c6a3adc8804e3335b4db3a.webm?t=1789286668\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4436240/extras/ce90e3d355c6a3adc8804e3335b4db3a.mp4?t=1789286668\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Secrets Beneath the Surface</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Multiple layers of hidden content and meta-puzzles waiting to be uncovered</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Observant players will discover clues hiding in plain sight</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"360\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4436240/extras/44a09f38ff69abb050aff6c158648eaa.poster.avif?t=1789286668\" width=\"640\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4436240/extras/44a09f38ff69abb050aff6c158648eaa.webm?t=1789286668\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4436240/extras/44a09f38ff69abb050aff6c158648eaa.mp4?t=1789286668\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Created by the Minds Behind Beat Saber</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Developed by the  creator of <i>Beat Saber</i> alongside the game\u2019s former game director \u2014 reuniting to create something completely different.</p> </div>", "short_desc": "Invert the world around you in this atmospheric pixel-art puzzle platformer. Escape an alien spaceship with your dog using mysterious artifacts that reshape reality, uncover hidden secrets, and solve increasingly difficult handcrafted puzzles.", "header_image": "https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4436240/911729fdf9b7cbe7f27a3743aea5f4ae5cef774b/header.jpg?t=1789286668", "screenshots": [], "tags": ["Puzzle Platformer", "2D", "Pixel Graphics", "Retro", "Adventure", "Stylized"], "developers": "Jan & Josh", "publishers": "Jan & Josh", "release_date": "Coming soon", "price": "Coming Soon", "appid": "4436240", "review_type": "Recommended", "curator_desc": "17 September 2026 - Demo", "yt_link": "https://youtu.be/I8rI3x26ZdA", "first_seen": 1789596000.0, "review_rank": 13}